{
  "name": "Hot pour",
  "category": "Fluids",
  "description": "Hot liquid poured from a moving spout into a glass on a table, steam rising off its surface. FLIP liquid at up to 256 cells with surface tension, an open top and whitewater; steam at up to 192 cells that takes the liquid as its heat source and collider. Set the Time row to 1 - 120.",
  "thumbnail": "hot_pour.png",
